note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note contract 5 layout lines 153-165: the SHA context layout of lines 163-164 as corrected by erratum E5
note (count is a scalar field: COUNT omitted). A 104-byte
note uchar array is passed as `c edit shactx`, every field is set with put, the bytes are written to
note stdout, then count and state[7] are read back with get (exit 90/91 on mismatch).
note stdout = oracle exp/l5-shactx.out (python3 struct; gcc offsetof oracle/s5s7/offsetof.c agrees).
om2
layout shactx 104
field state uint 8 at 0 little
field count ulong at 32 little
field buf uchar 64 at 40 little
end
fn fill c edit shactx to void
for i ulong 8
put c state i add 0x10203040 uint i
end
put c count 0x0123456789abcdef
for j ulong 64
put c buf j uchar add mul j 3 1
end
end
fn cnt c view shactx to ulong
ret get c count
end
fn st7 c view shactx to uint
ret get c state 7
end
fn main to int
c = new uchar 104 0
fill c
w = write 1 c 0 104
if ne cnt c 0x0123456789abcdef
ret 90
end
if ne st7 c 0x10203047
ret 91
end
ret 0
end
